    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξαλμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽἐξάλλομαἰ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήδημα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>distance, interval,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μέγιστον ἔ. οὐρανὸς καὶ γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Adv.</u>
					209.2
				</span></i>
			 (s. v.l.), cf. Sch. <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				30
			</span></i> (nisi leg.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξαρμα</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἐ. ἀπὸ ζῳδίου ἐπὶ ζῴδιον,</span> of
			the sun or moon, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>S.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, cf. Barbill. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(3).104
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
